    "comment_count": 3,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58370433?u=f27c5d8743e4a42fc8bc9fe3bd6484f6571061cb&v=4",
                "login": "abeldekat",
                "resourcePath": "/abeldekat",
                "url": "https://github.com/abeldekat"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hello @rieje,\r\n\r\nThanks for the question!\r\n\r\n> How to have bookmark clues e.g. 'a, 'b, 'c? and some mappings beginning with g in mini.files?\r\n\r\nOne of the reasons to not automatically activate `mini.clue` with `mini.files` is the conflicting `'` regarding bookmarks and Neovim's native marks.\r\n\r\nIs there a reason you prefer `mini.clue`, instead of using the help window(`g?`) provided by mini.files?\r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\n\r\nI think the answer in [this](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1195#discussioncomment-10556712) discussion is applicable\r\n",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hello <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/rieje/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/rieje\">@rieje</a>,</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks for the question!</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">How to have bookmark clues e.g. 'a, 'b, 'c? and some mappings beginning with g in mini.files?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">One of the reasons to not automatically activate <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.clue</code> with <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.files</code> is the conflicting <code class=\"notranslate\">'</code> regarding bookmarks and Neovim's native marks.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Is there a reason you prefer <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.clue</code>, instead of using the help window(<code class=\"notranslate\">g?</code>) provided by mini.files?</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">EDIT:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I think the answer in <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1195#discussioncomment-10556712\" data-hovercard-type=\"discussion\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1195/hovercard?comment_id=10556712\">this</a> discussion is applicable</p>",
            "bodyText": "Hello @rieje,\nThanks for the question!\n\nHow to have bookmark clues e.g. 'a, 'b, 'c? and some mappings beginning with g in mini.files?\n\nOne of the reasons to not automatically activate mini.clue with mini.files is the conflicting ' regarding bookmarks and Neovim's native marks.\nIs there a reason you prefer mini.clue, instead of using the help window(g?) provided by mini.files?\nEDIT:\nI think the answer in this discussion is applicable",
