            },
            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "@echasnovski I'm also wondering how to have bookmark clue suggestions like OP and I don't see why this is marked as the answer (the linked discussion talks about getting the mapping to work if mini.clues is also used, not getting the mapping suggestions with mini.clues). `'<char>` mapping works, but not suggestions for bookmark keys on `'`. `g?` shows the bookmark keys, of course, but that's not integration with mini.files unless mini.file buffers are special and this is not possible for some reason. mini.clue suggestions for bookmarks is as useful as mini.clue suggestions for anything.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/echasnovski/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski\">@echasnovski</a> I'm also wondering how to have bookmark clue suggestions like OP and I don't see why this is marked as the answer (the linked discussion talks about getting the mapping to work if mini.clues is also used, not getting the mapping suggestions with mini.clues). <code class=\"notranslate\">'&lt;char&gt;</code> mapping works, but not suggestions for bookmark keys on <code class=\"notranslate\">'</code>. <code class=\"notranslate\">g?</code> shows the bookmark keys, of course, but that's not integration with mini.files unless mini.file buffers are special and this is not possible for some reason. mini.clue suggestions for bookmarks is as useful as mini.clue suggestions for anything.</p>",
            "bodyText": "@echasnovski I'm also wondering how to have bookmark clue suggestions like OP and I don't see why this is marked as the answer (the linked discussion talks about getting the mapping to work if mini.clues is also used, not getting the mapping suggestions with mini.clues). '<char> mapping works, but not suggestions for bookmark keys on '. g? shows the bookmark keys, of course, but that's not integration with mini.files unless mini.file buffers are special and this is not possible for some reason. mini.clue suggestions for bookmarks is as useful as mini.clue suggestions for anything.",
